**Given:**

Simplify: dfrac{[72 ÷ {6 × (3 + 2)} + 5² - 8] × 5}{97}

**Formula used:**

Follow BODMAS: Brackets → Orders → Division → Multiplication → Addition → Subtraction

**Calculation:**

dfrac{[72 ÷ {6 × (3 + 2)} + 5² - 8] × 5}{97}

⇒ dfrac{[72 ÷ {6 × 5} + 25 - 8] × 5}{97}

⇒ dfrac{[72 ÷ 30 + 25 - 8] × 5}{97}

⇒ dfrac{[2.4 + 25 - 8] × 5}{97}

⇒ dfrac{[19.4] × 5}{97}

⇒ dfrac{97}{97}

⇒ 1

**∴ The correct answer is option (2).**

